1757	79	108	Day 23	Querying in Hibernate	{"Day": "Day 23", "Topic": "Querying in Hibernate", "Sub Topics": "How to query with hibernate query language (HQL)\\nHow to query with Criteria API\\nCreating queries with Native SQL", "Topic number": "19"}
1758	79	111	Day 23	Spring with Hibernate	{"Day": "Day 23", "Topic": "Spring with Hibernate", "Sub Topics": "Integrating Spring with Hibernate", "Topic number": "20"}
1759	79	113	Day 25-27	Spring Boot	{"Day": "Day 25-27", "Topic": "Spring Boot", "Sub Topics": "\\"Spring boot and its benefits | Spring Boot Dependencies, | Auto-Configuration & Runtime | Actuators | DevTools |Spring Boot starters thymeleaf views\\nSpring REST introduction, advantages, implementing REST and HTTP methods, Case study demo with all methods\\"\\n\\"Maven Dependency | Auto Generated credentials | Spring Security Filter | Spring Security Configuration | Ant Matchers | Basic Auth Token | JWT\\"\\nException Handling on REST end point", "Topic number": "21", "Duration in Hrs.": "40"}
1760	79	117	Day 28-29	Spring Data JPA	{"Day": "Day 28-29", "Topic": "Spring Data JPA", "Sub Topics": "\\"Overview | JDBC template API | Data Source Configuration | RowMapper Interface | JdbcTemplate Example\\"\\n\\"Entity Mapping, Id Mapping, Columns Mapping | Inheritence Mapping | Embeded (Composition) Mapping, Association Mapping | JPQL\\"\\nEmbedded H2 and Embedded MongoDb\\nCRUD/JPA/MONGO Repository and custom implementation\\nSpring Test – unit testing (repository, API, Service), Spring Test Mocking, Introduction to API documentation Swagger", "Topic number": "22"}
1761	79	122	Day 30	Fundamentals of Architecture & Design Patterns	{"Day": "Day 30", "Topic": "Fundamentals of Architecture & Design Patterns", "Sub Topics": "Kind of Applications, SOA based solutions Microservices Architecture, Important attributes of Microservices, Thought behind Microservices, Monolith features and challenges, Advantages and Disadvantages of Microservices, Microservices Frameworks, Best Practices, Design Patterns, Architecture, 12 Factor methodology and its implications on Microservices architecture", "Topic number": "23", "Duration in Hrs.": "32"}
1762	79	123	Day 31	MS Patterns & Guidelines	{"Day": "Day 31", "Topic": "MS Patterns & Guidelines", "Topic number": "24"}
1763	79	124	Day 32-33	MS Implementation with Spring Boot & Spring Cloud	{"Day": "Day 32-33", "Topic": "MS Implementation with Spring Boot & Spring Cloud", "Sub Topics": "What is Netflix OSS?, What is Spring Cloud?, Service Discovery with Spring Cloud Netflix Eureka, Client-Side Load Balancing with Spring Cloud Load Balancer, Implementing Microservices along with Eureka and Load Balancer, OpenFeign declarative RestClient,\\nSpring Cloud Circuit Breaker with Resilience4J, Understand how software circuit breakers protect against cascade failure, Use Spring Cloud Circuit breaker with Resilience4J to implement circuit breakers, Establish simple monitoring of circuit breakers using Prometheus dashboard, Spring Cloud Configuration Server and Client\\nAPI Gateway - Spring Cloud Gateway, Distributed Log tracing with Spring Cloud Sleuth and Zipkin, Introduction to Spring Security, Basic Auth, CORS", "Topic number": "25"}
1903	85	1	\N	Core Java, OOP & JVM Basics	{"Topic": "Core Java, OOP & JVM Basics", "# Questions": "8", "Rationale (Why It's Pre-Entry, Not In-Program)": "Week 1 begins with a refresher, not a first-teach; the parallel DSA track assumes fluent Java syntax from Day 1."}
